  "details": "When playing in desktop mode, opening the Steam overlay causes VRChat to miss inputs.\n\nEdit for clarification: This applies to input release events, meaning inputs will get stuck until they are pressed again.\n\nFor example:\n\n- Open the Steam overlay with Shift + Escape -> VRChat will now miss that Shift has been released.\n\n- Press Escape to close the Steam overlay (Not Shift Escape)\n\n- The player is now in permanent running mode\n\n- Press Escape: This will enable the save mode (Linked to Shift Escape being an awkward shortcut since it activates when opening the menu when running)\n\nThe same thing applies to walking when pressing W or turning when using comma and period.",
